    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for database connection lifecycle management in Analytics module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Ensures database connections are properly released on scope exit, preventing:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Connection pool exhaustion</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Resource leaks on early returns</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Connection leaks in exception paths</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Phase 3 Batch A-2: Close 20 HIGH-severity db_connection_leak gaps</para>
<para>Copyright (c) 2025 VCC-URN Project SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 </para>
    </detaileddescription>
